      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on an op-ed about the history of public health mandates. can u give me a quick summary of the main arguments scientists use to support mandatory vaccination protocols vs what the civil liberties advocates usually say? i want to make sure i've got the core points right.",
